A Survey of Recent Results.

By [fermat.sheaf], no three positive integers satisfy a^3 + b^3 = c^3.
By [gauss.sheaf], the sum of the first hundred numbers is 5050.
By [collatz.sheaf], it is well known that 27 comes down to 1.
By [twoarcs.sheaf], the logarithm has a global branch on the circle.

Trivially.
The value of this survey is zero.
Without loss of generality, it was worth writing.
QED.
